<title>USA: FSF Financial receives repurchase approval.</title>
<headline>FSF Financial receives repurchase approval.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSF Financial Corp said Monday that it had received the necessary approval from the Office of Thrift Supervision to repurchase up to 10 percent of the thrift holding company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it may repurchase up to 330,431 shares of its common stock in open market transactions from time to time during the next 12 months, subject to the discretion of management pursuant to the terms of the stock repurchase plan. FSF shares rose 5/16 to 14-9/16 on Nasdaq Monday.</p>
<p>--((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
